## **Small-Angle Neutron Scattering study of solubilization of tributyl phosphate in aqueous solutions of L64 Pluronic triblock copolymers** 

J. CAUSSE[§, ][¢] , J. OBERDISSE[±] , J. JESTIN[¥] , S. LAGERGE[§, *] 

