The structure in presence of TBP has been analyzed assuming that all droplets are identical in composition. From the overlap in the Porod regime as TBP is added to a fixed amount of L64, it has been concluded that the copolymer decorates the interface. Equivalent Porod radii RPorod have been deduced from the specific surface S/V measured at large angles using eq.(2), and they have been used to estimate the number of TBP oil molecules and L64 in each droplet (cf. Table 1). 

