## **3.2.2. Mb.** 

The SAXS profile and _S_ ( _q_ ) for the Mb gel do not show any peak at _q <_ 1 nm _[−]_[1] in the examined _q_ range (Figs. 2b and 3b). The PCF clearly reveals at least 3 coordination shells (Fig. 4b) and remains 

