Magnetic structures and magnetic phase transitions in the Mn-doped orthoferrite TbFeO3 studied by neutron powder diffraction 

Harikrishnan S. Nair,[1,][ a)] Tapan Chatterji,[2] C. M. N. Kumar,[3, 4] Thomas Hansen,[2] Hariharan Nhalil,[5] Suja Elizabeth,[5] and Andr´e M. Strydom[1, 6] 

