## **Synchrotron X-ray tomography investigation of 3D morphology** 

## **of intermetallic phases and pores and their effect on the** 

## **mechanical properties of cast Al-Cu alloys** 

Yuliang Zhao[ a, b, c] , Zhi Wang[ a, b] , Chun Zhang[ c, d] , Weiwen Zhang[ a, b ] * a Guangdong Key Laboratory for Advanced Metallic Materials Processing, South China University of Technology, Guangzhou, 510641, China 

b National Engineering Research Center of Near-net-shape Forming for Metallic Materials, South China University of Technology, Guangzhou, 510641, China 

c School of Engineering & Computer Science, University of Hull, East Yorkshire, HU6 7RX, UK 

