Figs. 2(a) and (b) show the SEM images of the 0.5Fe alloy and 1.0Fe alloy, respectively. The microstructure of the as-cast alloys shows that β-Al7Cu2Fe (β-Fe), α-Al15(FeMn)3Cu2 (α- 

