PE and PE- _g_ samples were washed for 24 hrs, while PE- _v_ samples were washed for 120 hrs. Afterwards, each sample was dried under reduced pressure at 140 °C for at least 12 hrs. For comparison, peroxide crosslinked PE was also prepared (see Supporting Information). 

