## **Site-selective and real-time observation of bimolecular electron transfer during photocatalytic water splitting** 

**Alexander Britz[1, 2*] | Sergey I. Bokarev[3] | Tadesse A. Assefa[1,†] | Éva G. Bajnóczi[4] | Zoltán Németh[4] | György Vankó[4] | Nils Rockstroh[5] | Henrik Junge[5] | Matthias Beller[5] | Gilles Doumy[6] | Anne Marie March[6] | Stephen H. Southworth[6] | Stefan Lochbrunner[3] | Oliver Kühn[3] | Christian Bressler[1,2] | Wojciech Gawelda[1,7*‡]** 

