When the applied magnetic field is perpendicular to the incident neutron beam ( _**H**_ 0 ⊥ _**k**_ 0), the elastic total (nuclear + magnetic) unpolarized SANS cross section d _Σ_ /d _Ω_ and the purely magnetic SANS cross section d _Σ_ M/d _Ω_ are given as: 

