ture. The results of one such simulation are presented in Fig. 13a. We then take the ratio between the two diffraction curves, replicating the process by which we generate the reduced diffraction patterns (as discussed in Sec. II of the main text). This gives a simulated reduced diffraction curve which can be fit to extract its centroid, as shown in Fig. 13b. Finally, this process is repeated for different strain values in the layer, generating a calibration curve, as shown in Fig. 13c. 

