## **Electrically Enhanced Exchange Bias via Solid State Magneto-Ionics** 

Peyton D. Murray[1] , Christopher J. Jensen,[2] Alberto Quintana,[2] Junwei Zhang[3] , Xixiang Zhang[3] , Alexander J. Grutter,[4] Brian J. Kirby,[4] and Kai Liu[1,2* ] 

_1Physics Department, University of California, Davis, CA 95616, USA_ 

_2Physics Department, Georgetown University, Washington, DC 20057, USA_ 

_3King Abdullah University of Science & Technology, Thuwal 23955-6900, Saudi Arabia_ 

