# **Phase transition kinetics revealed in laser-heated dynamic diamond anvil cells** 

Matthew Ricks,[1] Arianna E. Gleason,[2] Francesca Miozzi,[3] Hong Yang,[4] Stella Chariton,[5] Vitali B. Prakapenka,[5] Stanislav V. Sinogeikin,[6] Richard L. Sandberg,[1] Wendy L. Mao,[4] and Silvia Pandolfi[2, 7] 

