# **Assembling PNIPAM-Capped Gold Nanoparticles in Aqueous Solutions** 

Binay P. Nayak, _[†]_ Hyeong Jin Kim, _[†]_ Srikanth Nayak, _[†]_[,] _[∥]_ Wenjie Wang, _[‡]_ Wei Bu, _[¶]_ Surya K. Mallapragada, _[∗]_[,] _[†]_ and David Vaknin _[∗]_[,] _[§]_ 

