# **Thermally-driven reorientation of the Néel vector in altermagnetic MnTe** 

Thomas J. Hicken,[1,] _[ ∗]_ Klára Uhlířová,[2] Helena Reichlová,[3] Ondrej Caha,[4] Vincent C. Morano,[1] Oliver Amin,[5] Alfred Dal Din,[5] J. Hugo Dil,[6, 7] Marek Duchan,[4] Dominik Kriegner,[3] Hubertus Luetkens,[1] Zeno Maesen,[1] Jan Martinek,[2] Zaher Salman,[1] Peter Wadley,[5] Oksana Zaharko,[1] Juraj Krempaský,[6] and Jonas A. Krieger[1,] _[ †]_ 

