# Elucidating Norrish Type-I reactive pathways by ultrafast X-ray absorption spectroscopy 

Martin Graßl[1,2] , Pablo Unzueta[1,3] , Andreas E. Hillers-Bendtsen[1,3] , Yusong Liu[1,4] , Diptarka Hait[1,3,5,6] , Alice E. Green[1,7,8] , Xinxin Cheng[4] , Felix Allum[1,][9] , Taran Driver[1,4] , Ruaridh Forbes[4,10] , James. M. Glownia[4] , Erik Isele[1] , Kirk A. Larsen[1,4] , Xiang Li[4] , Ming-Fu Lin[4] , Razib Obaid[4] , Adam Summers[1,4] , Emily Thierstein[1] , Jun Wang[1] , James P. Cryan[1,4] , Matthias F. Kling[1,2,4] , Todd J. Martinez[1,3] , and Thomas J. A. Wolf[1,4] 

