# **Near itinerancy and slow singlet formation in the triangular lattice NaRuO** 2 

Charles C. Tam,[1] Alon Hendler Avidor,[1] Pritam Bhattacharyya,[2] Yongseong Choi,[3] Daniel Haskel,[3] Sven Luther,[4] Hlynur Gretarsson,[5] Liviu Hozoi,[2] and Stephen D. Wilson[1,] _[ ∗]_ 

> 1 _Materials Department, University of California Santa Barbara, Santa Barbara, California 93106 USA_ 

> 2 _Institute for Theoretical Solid State Physics, Leibniz IFW Dresden, Helmholtzstraße 20, Dresden 01069, Germany_ 

> 3 _Advanced Photon Source, Argonne National Laboratory, Argonne, Illinois 60439, USA_ 

> 4 _Hochfeld-Magnetlabor Dresden (HLD-EMFL), Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden-Rossendorf, 01328 Dresden, Germany_ 

