# **Physics-informed X-ray tomography of magnetization and material parameters** 

Alexander Setescak,[1, 2,] _[ ∗]_ Polly Mitchell,[3] Luke J. R. Higgins,[4] Burkhard Kaulich,[4] Luke Turnbull,[3, 4] Rikako Yamamoto,[3, 5] Marina Raboni Ferreira,[3] Daniel A. Mayoh,[6] Geetha Balakrishnan,[6] Anuj Chavan,[1] Dieter Suess,[1] Amalio Fern´andez-Pacheco,[7] Manuel Guizar-Sicairos,[8, 9] Claire Donnelly,[3, 8, 10] and Claas Abert[1] 

