The energy weight _λ[E]_ balances this data misfit against the micromagnetic energy. 

The micromagnetic energy enters Eq. (2) as the _physics prior_ . This penalty increases with the energy of the magnetization state, driving the reconstruction toward physically plausible configurations. It sums the exchange, demagnetizing, and bulk Dzyaloshinskii–Moriya (DMI) energies, 

